[83.24624, "o", "\u001b[0;36m\u001b[1mOpen-Core Model:\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n\u001b[0;32m\u001b[1mCommunity Edition (Free - Apache 2.0):\u001b[0m\r\n  ✓ Core antivirus engine\r\n  ✓ CLI management tools\r\n  ✓ Community support via GitHub\r\n  \u001b[2mTarget: Developers, researchers, small deployments\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n\u001b[1;33m\u001b[1mProfessional Edition (Projected $45/endpoint/year):\u001b[0m\r\n  ✓ Everything in Community\r\n  ✓ Web dashboard \u001b[2m(to be built)\u001b[0m\r\n  ✓ Centralized management \u001b[2m(to be built)\u001b[0m\r\n  ✓ Email support\r\n  \u001b[2mTarget: Small-medium businesses\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n\u001b[0;35m\u001b[1mEnterprise Edition (Projected $89/endpoint/year):\u001b[0m\r\n  ✓ Everything in Professional\r\n"]
