[95.271449, "o", "\u001b[0;32m\u001b[1mQ4 2024 - What's Actually Done:\u001b[0m\r\n  ✓ Core AV engine with YARA-X\r\n  ✓ ML detection model (synthetic-trained)\r\n  ✓ eBPF behavioral monitoring\r\n  ✓ CLI tools and daemon\r\n  ✓ Basic quarantine system\r\n  ✓ Open-source release (Apache 2.0)\r\n\r\n\u001b[1;33m\u001b[1mQ1-Q2 2025 - Next Steps (If Funded):\u001b[0m\r\n  ○ Web dashboard (need frontend dev)\r\n  ○ Real malware testing (need samples + lab)\r\n  ○ Enterprise features (need team)\r\n  ○ Beta customer onboarding\r\n  ○ Start certification process (SOC 2)\r\n\r\n\u001b[0;36m\u001b[1mQ3-Q4 2025 - Growth Phase (If Successful):\u001b[0m\r\n  ○ Scale to 100+ customers\r\n  ○ Advanced threat hunting\r\n  ○ SIEM integrations\r\n  ○ Expand team to 5-8 people\r\n  ○ Series A fundraising\r\n\r\n"]
[97.276228, "o", "\u001b[0;35m\u001b[1m═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n\u001b[0;36m\u001b[1mWhat We Need to Succeed:\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n\u001b[0;31m\u001b[1mCritical Needs:\u001b[0m\r\n  \u001b[0;31m!\u001b[0m Technical co-founder (security background)\r\n  \u001b[0;31m!\u001b[0m Access to real malware samples\r\n  \u001b[0;31m!\u001b[0m Security testing lab/infrastructure\r\n  \u001b[0;31m!\u001b[0m Design partners for beta testing\r\n  \u001b[0;31m!\u001b[0m $500K-2M seed funding\r\n\r\n\u001b[1;33m\u001b[1mKey Risks:\u001b[0m\r\n  \u001b[1;33m→\u001b[0m Solo founder - bus factor of 1\r\n  \u001b[1;33m→\u001b[0m Unproven detection in production\r\n  \u001b[1;33m→\u001b[0m No enterprise sales experience\r\n  \u001b[1;33m→\u001b[0m Competing with 00M+ funded companies\r\n  \u001b[1;33m→\u001b[0m Long sales cycles in security\r\n\r\n\u001b[0;32m\u001b[1mWhy It Could Still Work:\u001b[0m\r\n  \u001b[0;32m✓\u001b[0m Memory safety is a real advantage\r\n  \u001b[0;32m✓\u001b[0m ARM64 timing is good\r\n  \u001b[0;32m✓\u001b[0m Open-source builds trust\r\n  \u001b[0;32m✓\u001b[0m Lower TCO resonates with buyers\r\n  \u001b[0;32m✓\u001b[0m Technical foundation is solid\r\n\r\n"]
